() Tj T*
(4 Procedure) Tj T*
(Step 1: Document the area is free of previous materials.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Escalate the result against the acceptance criterion.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Verify the second-person check.) Tj T*
(Step 4: Record the batch number.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5 Records) Tj T*
(Records of deviation handling are kept for five years after batch expiry.) Tj T*
